## Form-validity screen applied to our own replacement set
   106 entities, 424 claims, 424 distinct texts

   AUROC of each no-model feature on each contrast.
   Chance is 0.5. `role_is_founder` is the manipulation, not a confound:
   it should separate `regime` and nothing else.

   feature                          regime                 truth             staleness
   n_chars               0.488 [0.41,0.57]     0.507 [0.43,0.59]     0.496 [0.42,0.57]
   n_words               0.497 [0.42,0.57]     0.507 [0.43,0.58]     0.500 [0.42,0.57]
   n_name_tokens         0.574 [0.52,0.63]     0.508 [0.45,0.57]     0.489 [0.44,0.54]
   has_digit             0.505 [0.48,0.53]     0.505 [0.48,0.53]     0.500 [0.48,0.52]
   person_frequency      0.500 [0.50,0.50]     0.500 [0.50,0.50]     0.500 [0.50,0.50]
   role_is_founder       1.000 [1.00,1.00]     0.500 [0.50,0.50]     0.500 [0.50,0.50]

   model log-probability, for comparison:
   pmi (Qwen3.5-27B-4bit)                  0.521                 0.852                 0.415

## reading
   PASS if every surface feature except role_is_founder sits at chance
   on every contrast. A surface feature above chance on `truth` or
   `staleness` would mean the replacement set carries its own confound.
